('128.4.b.13.E',3,'After gathering facts you show understanding by:','["explaining them in your own words", "copying exactly", "hiding them", "skipping them"]'::jsonb,0,'Understanding means you can restate.','original'),
('128.4.b.13.E',3,'Which shows you understood a fact about the moon?','["Orbit.", "The moon orbits the Earth.", "Earth.", "Moon."]'::jsonb,1,'A full statement shows understanding.','original'),
