('128.4.b.13.G',3,'An oral presentation with slides and pictures is:','["silent", "multimodal", "only written", "only a map"]'::jsonb,1,'Multimodal uses several modes.','original'),
('128.4.b.2.A.i',3,'Decode the multisyllabic word elefante. How many syllables does it have?','["3", "5", "4", "2"]'::jsonb,2,'E-le-fan-te has four syllables.','original'),
('128.4.b.2.A.i',3,'To decode a long word, a good strategy is to:','["cover it", "guess the first letter", "skip it", "break it into syllables"]'::jsonb,3,'Syllabication helps decoding.','original'),
('128.4.b.2.A.ii',3,'Which letter in Spanish can make the sound /k/ when followed by a, o or u?','["c", "s", "h", "z"]'::jsonb,0,'C before a, o, u sounds like k.','original'),
('128.4.b.2.A.ii',3,'In cielo, the letter c before i sounds like:','["k", "s", "b", "ch"]'::jsonb,1,'Soft c sounds like s in Latin American Spanish.','original'),
