('128.4.b.2.B.i',3,'How should you spell a multisyllabic word like mariposa?','["with no vowels", "backward", "one syllable at a time", "by guessing"]'::jsonb,2,'Spell syllable by syllable.','original'),
('128.4.b.2.B.ii',3,'Which word has a diphthong?','["casa", "luna", "mesa", "cuento"]'::jsonb,3,'Cuento contains ue.','original'),
