('128.4.b.2.D',2,'Good cursive handwriting keeps letters:','["huge and crooked", "tiny and uneven", "upside down", "evenly spaced and the same size"]'::jsonb,3,'Neatness aids legibility.','original'),
('128.4.b.3.A',2,'A dictionary entry can tell you a word''s:','["meaning and pronunciation", "price", "page color", "author"]'::jsonb,0,'Dictionaries show meaning and pronunciation.','original'),
